hadiths[72]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3992","as nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn an ka ayk ghwra chla gya awr asay dshmn lay gyay، lykn jb mslmanwn nay an pr fth hasl ky tw asay waps kr dya gya۔ ayk rwayt myn kha gya hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm ky wfat kay bad aap ka ayk ghlam bhag kr bazntynywn say ja mla awr jb mslmanwn nay an pr fth hasl ky tw khald bn۔ wlyd nay asay waps kr dya۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3993","**Jubair bin Mut'im (Radi Allahu Anhu)** ne bayan kiya ke woh aur **Usman bin Affan (Radi Allahu Anhu)** Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas gaye aur kaha: \Aap ne Bani Muttalib ko Khaibar ke maal-e-ghanimat ka kuch hissa (khums se) diya aur humein nahi diya"","" halaanke rishtey mein hum sab aap ke barabar hain (sab Abd Manaf ki olad hain).\"" Aap ne jawab diya: \""Bani Hashim aur Bani Muttalib ek hi hain.\"" Jubair (Radi Allahu Anhu) ne kaha: \""Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Bani Abd Shams aur Bani Naufal ko kuch nahi diya.\"" (Bukhari)."""""
"3994","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm js bsty myn aao awr thhrw، tmhara hsh asy myn hay، lykn jw bsty allh awr as kay rswl ky nafrmany kray gy، as ka panchwan hsh allh awr as kay rswl kay pas jayay ga awr jw baqy rhay ga wh tmhara hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3995","khwlh alansaryh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: ”mrd ghlt tryqay say allh ka mal hasl kryn gay awr qyamt kay dn jhnm myn jayyn gay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3996","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk dn an kay drmyan khray hwyay awr ghnymt kay baray myn khyant، as kay sath slwk awr as say jry hr chyz kw ayk sngyn maamlh qrar dya۔ phr frmaya kh myn tm myn say ksy kw qyamt kay dn aysa nh dykhwn jw awnt ky grdn myn ghnghrao dalay awr mjh say asay bchanay kay lyay khay، kywnkh myn yh khwn ga kh myn as kay lyay kchh nhyn kr skta jysa kh myn nay asay pwry hdayt dy hay، myn tm myn say ksy kw qyamt kay dn aysa nh dykhwn jw as ky grdn pr ghwra lay kr aata hw awr myn asay bchanay kay lyay khta hwn kh myn asay kchh nhyn day skta۔ mjhay tm myn say ksy kw qyamt kay dn aysa nh mlay kh wh as kay glay myn phnda dalay awr mjh say khay kh myn as kay lyay kchh nhyn kr skta jysa kh myn nay asay mkml hdayt day dy hay، mjhay qyamt kay dn aysa nh mlay kh as ky grdn pr chykhtay hwyay mjh say yh khay kh myn asay bchanay kay lyay kchh nhyn kr skta tm myn say ksy kw qyamt kay dn as ky grdn pr thpr phwr kr mjhay chhranay kay lyay aata hw، kywnkh myn khwn ga kh myn as kay lyay kchh nhyn kr skta jysa kh myn nay asay mkml hdayt dy hay، mjhay qyamt kay dn aysa nh mlay kh as ky grdn pr swna awr chandy dal kr mjh say daa ky jayay، kywnkh myn yh khwn ga kh myn as kay lyay kchh nhyn kr skta awr as ky pyrwy krnay walay kay lyay myn kchh nhyn kr skta js chyz kay baray myn wh bay ayman tha as say njat hasl krna chahta hay، (bkhary w mslm، yh mslm ka qwl hay jw zyadh mkml hay۔)"
"3997","as nay byan kya kh ayk shkhs nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw ayk ghlam kay sath pysh kya js ka nam mdam tha، awr jb mysm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay awnt ky znjyr atar rhay thay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm kw ayk tyr lga js say aap sly allh alyh wslm hlak hw gyay۔ lwgwn nay kha asay mbark hw wh jnt myn jayay ga۔ lykn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hrgz nhyn، as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، khybr kay dn as nay ghnymt kay mal myn say jw chadr ly thy jw tqsym shdh hss myn say nhyn thy، as pr aag bhrk athay gy۔ jb lwgwn nay yh sna tw ayk aadmy nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ayk jwty ka pta ya dw jwty kay ptay lay kr aaya awr kha: \aag ka ayk pta\"" ya \""aag kay dw jwtay kay ptay\""۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3998","abdallh by amrw nay byan kya kh jb krkrh namy ayk shkhs ky wfat hwyy jw kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay saman ka ancharj tha tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”wh jhnm myn jayay ga۔“ lwgwn nay ja kr dykha tw ayk dhary dar awny kpra mla jsay as nay ghnymt myn say nkala tha۔ *as aadmy kay nam kay amla kay baray myn shk hay۔ krkyra awr krkyra ka bhy zkr hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3999","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh hm apnay sfrwn myn shhd awr angwr hasl krtay awr nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas layay bghyr kha lytay thay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4000","abdallh by۔ mghfl nay kha: khybr kay dn mjhay chknayy ky khal mly، jb myn nay as dn ksy kw nh dynay ka fyslh kya tw myn nay mr kr dykha tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mjhay dykh kr mskra rhay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4001","abw amamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khda nay mjhay anbyaa pr fzylt dy hay“ ya yh khh kr kh ”myry amt kw dwsry amtwn pr fzylt dy hay awr hmaray lyay ghnymtyn hlal ky hyn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4002","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as dn، yany ywm hnyn، frmaya: ”js nay ksy kafr kw qtl kya wh as say why hasl krta hay jw as nay lya“۔ abw tlhh nay as dn bys aadmywn kw qtl kr dya awr an say jw kchh lya wh lay lya۔ darymy nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4003","awf by۔ malk alashjay awr khald bn۔ alwlyd nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh dya kh qatl kay pas why hwna chahyay jw as nay qtl kya tha، awr asay panchwyn hsay myn tqsym nhyn kya tha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4004","abdallh by۔ msawd rzy allh anh nay kha kh jng bdr myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay abwjhl ky tlwar anhyn dy thy، jysa kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay qtl kr dya tha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4005","abw lhm kay mokl amyr nay kha: myn apnay aaqaon kay sath khybr myn mwjwd tha jnhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say myray baray myn bat ky awr aap kw btaya kh myn ghlam hwn۔ as nay hkm dya kh mjh pr ayk tlwar bandhy jayay awr myn as kay pychhay chl rha tha۔ myn nay an kay samnay ayk daa pysh ky js kay sath myn an lwgwn kay sath slwk kya krta tha jn kay qbzay myn thay awr as nay mjhay hkm dya kh as ka kchh hsh rd kr kay rkh dwn۔ *ya tw as lyay kh wh chhwta aadmy tha، ya as lyay kh wh jwan tha۔ trmzy awr abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay، lykn mokhr alzkr ka nskhh \saman\"" pr khtm hwa۔"""""
"4006","mzmy by jryh nay kha: khybr hdybyh myn rhnay walwn myn tqsym hwa awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asay atharh hswn myn tqsym kya۔ fwj ayk hzar panch sw thy js myn tyn sw ghr swar thay awr as nay dw hsay ayk ghwr swar kw awr ayk pydl kw dya۔ abwdaod nay asay rwayt kya hay kh abn amr ky rwayt shyh hay awr as pr aml kya jata hay۔ mzmy ky rwayt myn ghlty yh thy kh anhwn nay tyn sw ghr swar kha jb kh dw sw thay۔"
"4007","hbyb by۔ mslmh alfhry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw dykha kh mal ghnymt ka ayk chwthayy sfr myn awr ayk thayy wapsy kay sfr myn dytay thay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4008","anhwn nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm panchwyn kay bnd hwnay kay bad ayk chwthayy mal ghnymt kay twr pr dytay thay awr jb waps aatay thay tw panchwyn kay bad ayk thayy chhwr dytay thay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4009","abwaljwyryh aljrmy khtay hyn: js zmanay myn maawyh gwrnr tha asay bazntynywn ky srzmyn myn dynar pr mshtml ayk srkh mrtban mla۔ by slym kay ayk aadmy nay man b kha۔ yzyd jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka shaby tha hm pr mamwr tha awr jb myn asay lay kr gya tw as nay mslmanwn myn why tqsym kr dya jysa kh as nay dwsrwn kw dya tha۔ as nay phr kha kh agr myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay nh sna hwta kh mal ghnymt srf panchwyn kay bnd hwnay kay bad dya jata hay tw wh mjhay day dytay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4010","abw mwsyٰ ashary rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh hm asy wqt phnchay jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay khybr kw fth kr lya tha awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay hmaray lyay ayk hsh mqrr kya tha (ya frmaya tha kh aap nay hmyn as myn say kchh dya tha)۔ as nay ksy aysay shkhs kw kchh nhyn dya jw fth khybr kay wqt mwjwd nhyn tha، srf an lwgwn kw hsh dytay thay jw as kay sath mwjwd thay، swayay an kay jw hmary kshty myn thay، jafr awr as kay sathywn kay jn kw as nay an kay sath kchh mqrr kya tha۔ *js fryq ka hwalh dya jata hay wh wh lwg hyn jw mkh say hbshh ky trf hjrt kr gyay thay awr ab waps aa rhay thay۔ aba daod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4011","yzyd by۔ khald rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb khybr ky jng myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ayk sathy ky wfat hwyy tw anhwn nay aap say as ka zkr kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apnay sathy kay lyay daa krw۔ jb lwgwn nay as kw dykha tw as nay kha kh tmhara sathy khda ky rah myn mal ghnymt myn bay ayman tha۔ anhwn nay as kay saman ky tlashy ly tw kchh yhwdy mwtywn ky mala mlay jn ky qymt dw drhm nhyn thy۔ asay malk، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4012","abdallh by۔ amrw nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mal ghnymt hasl kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay blal rzy allh anh kw aalan krnay ka hkm dya awr jb lwg ghnymt lay kr aayyn tw aap sly allh alyh wslm panchwan hsh lay kr tqsym kr dyn gay۔ ayk dn ayk aadmy as kay bad balwn ka ayk tkra lay kr aaya awr khnay lga: aay khda kay rswl yh mal ghnymt ka hsh hay۔ as nay pwchha kh kya myn nay blal kw tyn bar aalan krtay hwyay sna hay، jb as nay jwab dya kh as kay pas hay tw as nay pwchha kh asay lanay say ks chyz nay rwka؟ as nay kwyy azr pysh kya tw as nay kha kh tm asay qyamt kay dn khwd lay aana kywnkh myn tm say asay hrgz qbwl nhyn krwn ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4013","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald kay hwalay say kha kh an kay dada nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm، abwbkr awr amr rzy allh anh nay mal ghnymt myn bay aymany krnay walay ka saman jla dya awr asay mara۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4014","smwra by۔ jndb rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm frmaya krtay thay kh jw shkhs ghnymt myn khyant krnay walay kw chhpayay wh as jysa hay، asay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4015","aba sayd nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mal ghnymt kw tqsym krnay say phlay frwkht krnay say mna frmaya۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4016","abw amamh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hswn kw tqsym krnay say phlay bychnay say mna frmaya۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4017","qys ky byty khwlh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh yh mal tazh awr mytha hay awr jw asay shyh tryqay say hasl kray ga as myn brkt hwgy، lykn js nay khda awr as kay rswl ka aysa mal najayz tryqay say hasl kya jw as ky dl chahay as kay lyay qyamt kay dn jhnm kay swa kchh nhyn hwga۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4018","abn abas rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jng bdr myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw apny tlwar zwalfqar zaty ghnymt kay twr pr mly۔ abn majh nay asay nql kya hay awr trmzy nay mzyd kha hay kh yh wh chyz thy js kay baray myn anhwn nay jng ahd myn dykha tha۔"
"4019","rwafz b۔ sabt rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs allh awr ywm aakhrt pr ayman rkhta hw wh mslmanwn kay mal ghnymt myn say ghwray pr swar nh hw awr jb as kw kmzwr kr day tw asay waps nh rkhay، awr jw shkhs allh awr ywm aakhrt pr ayman rkhta hw wh mslmanwn kay mal ghnymt myn say kpray nh phnay awr jb asay dhagay myn bandhay tw asay waps nh rkhay“۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4020","mhmd by abwalmjald nay abdallh bn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt ky hay۔ abw awfa khtay hyn kh anhwn nay pwchha kh kya anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn khanay ka panchwan hsh mkhts kya tha awr jwab mla kh khybr kay dn anhwn nay khana pkr lya awr ayk aadmy aayay ga awr as myn say jtna as ky zrwrt hw ga lay jayay ga awr phr chla jayay ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4021","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn ayk lshkr kw mal ghnymt myn khana awr shhd mlta tha awr an say panchwan hsh bhy nhyn lya jata tha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4022","abdalrhmn kay mokl alqasm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ayk ashab say nql kya hay kh: hm ayk awnt kw ksy mhm myn bghyr tqsym kyay khatay thay، awr jb hm apnay ghrwn kw lwttay thay tw hmary zynwn kay thylay as kay gwsht say bhray hwtay thay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4023","abadh by۔ samt rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm frmaya krtay thay kh dhagay awr swyyan hwalay krw awr mal ghnymt myn khyant say bchw، kywnkh yh qyamt kay dn mjrmwn kay lyay mlamt ka baas hw ga۔ darymy nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4024","nsayy nay amrw bn alaas ky snd say rwayt ky hay۔ shayb js nay asay apnay wald kay akhtyar pr apnay dada ky trf say dya tha۔"
"4025","amrw by۔ shayb rzy allh anh nay apnay wald say rwayt ky kh an kay dada nay byan kya kh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm ayk awnt kay pas phnchay awr as kay kwhan say bal lay kr frmaya: ”lwgw، mjhay as mal ghnymt myn say kchh nhyn mla، yh bhy nhyn (as dwran angly athatay hwyay)، lykn panchwan awr panchwan tmhyn waps kr dya jata hay، lhza dhagay awr swyyan day dw۔ ayk aadmy hath myn balwn ky ayk gynd lay kr atha awr khnay lga، \myn nay yh kpra sydl kay nychay thyk krnay kay lyay lya hay۔\"" nby sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya، \""tmhyn wh ml skta hay jw myra awr bn abdalmtlb ka hay\"" lykn as shkhs nay kha، \""agr as ka ntyjh nklta hay tw myn ab smjhta hwn، * mjhay as ky kwyy khwahsh nhyn hay\"" awr as nay asay phynk dya۔ * lfzy twr pr \""agr yh as tk phnch jayay jw myn dykh rha hwn۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"4026","amrw by۔ abas rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn ayk awnt ky trf mnh kr kay nmaz prhayy jw ghnymt myn ly gyy thy، jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay slam kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay awnt kay phlw say ayk bal nkala awr frmaya: ”tmharay as mal ghnymt myn say myra kwyy hq nhyn hay، lykn panchwan hsh tmhyn waps kr dya jayay ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4027","jbyr by۔ mtam nay kha: jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay rshth darwn ka hsh bn hashm awr bn almtlb kay drmyan tqsym kya tw asman rzy allh anh۔ myn awr afan aap kay pas aayay awr arz kya kh khda kay rswl yh hmaray by hashm kay bhayy hyn jn ky fzylt say hm ankar nhyn krtay kh khda nay aap kw an kay baray myn js mqam pr rkha hay، lykn hmyn apnay an bhayywn kay baray myn btayyn jn kw aap nay hmyn chhwrtay hwyay kchh dya hay، halankh an ka awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka rshth why hay۔ bn almtlb as trh ka ayk jsm hyn\ awr as nay apny anglyan aaps myn jwr dyn۔ * sy ayf۔ bab 8a asay shafay nay nql kya hay، awr abwdaod awr nsayy ky rwayt myn bhy kchh aysa hy hay۔ as myn lkha hay kh \""myn awr bn almtlb qbl az aslam ya aslamy dwr myn alg alg nhyn rhay hyn awr wh awr hm ayk hyn\""۔"""""
"4028","abd alrhmn by۔ awf nay kha: jb myn bdr ky jng myn sf myn khra hwa tw myn nay apnay dayyn bayyn dykha awr jb myn nay dykha kh myn ansar kay dw jwanwn kay drmyan hwn tw myn nay chaha kh kash myn an say zyadh taqtwr mrdwn kay drmyan hwta۔ an myn say ayk nay mjhay chtky mary awr kha kh abw jhl kw jantay hw chcha؟ awr myn nay jwab dya، \han، lykn tm as say kya chahtay hw، bhtyjay؟\"" as nay kha: mjhay btaya gya hay kh wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw galy dyta hay، as ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، agr myn asay dykh lwn tw myn asay as wqt tk nhyn chhwrwn ga jb tk kh hm myn say jw phlay mrnay wala hay wh nh mr jayay۔ myn as pr hyran rh gya، awr phr dwsray nay mjhay chtky mary awr mjh say bhy yhy kha۔ kchh dyr phlay myn nay abwjhl kw lwgwn kay drmyan chkr lgatay hwyay dykha tw myn nay kha kh dykhw yh why hay js kay baray myn tm pwchh rhay thay۔ phr wh apny tlwaryn lay kr as ky trf dwr pray awr asay mara yhan tk kh asay qtl kr dya، as kay bad wh rswl allhﷺ kay pas gyay awr aap kw khbr dy۔ as nay pwchha kh an myn say ks nay asay mara hay awr dwnwn nay aysa krnay ka dawyٰ kya۔ as nay phr pwchha kh kya anhwn nay apny tlwarwn ka sfaya kr dya hay، jb anhwn nay jwab dya kh wh nhyn hyn tw as nay tlwarwn ky trf dykha awr kha kh tm dwnwn nay asay mar dala۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh kya kh jw kchh aap say lya jayay wh maaz rzy allh anh kay pas jayay۔ amrw by۔ aljmwh wh dwnwn aadmy maaz bn thay۔ amrw by۔ aljama awr maaz b۔ ’afra‘۔* ’afra‘ as ky man thy۔ an kay wald hars thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4029","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh jng bdr myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kwn malwm kray ga kh abwjhl kay sath kya hwa؟ abn msawd gyay awr malwm hwa kh afra kay dwnwn bytwn nay asay mara yhan tk kh wh mr gya tw as nay as ky darhy pkr ly awr kha kya tm abwjhl hw؟ as nay jwab dya: kya tm nay ayk aadmy say zyadh qtl kya hay؟ ayk wrzhn myn as nay kha، \kash zmyn kay jwty kay alawh kwyy awr mjhay mar dyta۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4030","sad b۔ abw wqas rzy allh anh nay kha: myn bytha hwa tha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk kmpny kw kchh dya lykn as kw chhwr dya jw mjhay sb say zyadh prkshsh tha۔ as lyay myn nay ath kr kha، tm nay flan kw kywn chhwr dya؟ myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myn asay mwmn smjhta hwn۔\ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: nhyn، mslman۔ sad rzy allh anh nay tyn bar as ka zkr kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay bhy yhy jwab dya، phr frmaya: myn ayk aadmy kw kchh dyta hwn halankh myn as say zyadh psnd krta hwn، as khwf say kh wh jhnm myn mnh ky trf phynk dya jayay۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) an dwnwn kay ayk nskhay myn zhry nay kha kh ghwr kya jayay kh aslam ayman ky tsdyq hay awr ayman achha aml hay۔"""""
"4031","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay bdr kay dn khray hw kr frmaya: asman rzy allh anh allh awr as kay rswl kay kam say nkl gyay hyn awr myn an ky trf say byat krwn ga۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asay hsh mqrr kya، lykn ksy awr kay lyay aysa nhyn kya jw ghyr hazr tha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4032","rfya by۔ khdyjh rzy allh anha nay kha kh mal ghnymt ky tqsym myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ds bkrywn kw awnt kay brabr smjhtay thay۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4033","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayk nby jw ghzwh pr nkla tha as nay apny qwm say kha kh kwyy as shkhs ky pyrwy nh kray js nay ksy aysy awrt say shady ky hw js kay sath wh rhna chahta hw lykn abhy tk aysa nh kya hw، ya js nay ghr bnayay hwn jn pr as nay abhy tk chhtyn nhyn lgayy hwn، ya js nay bhyryn ya hamlh awntny khrydy hw awr as kay bad wh nwjwan pyda krnay ka wqt tay kr kay shhr myn phncha۔ dwphr ky nmaz ya as kay bad as nay swrj kw btaya kh yh awr wh dwnwn hkm kay tht hyn awr khda say daa ky kh wh an kay lyay waps rkhay، as lyay asay waps rkha gya jb tk kh as nay mal ghnymt jma nh kr dya awr wh (yany aag) an kw bhsm krnay kay lyay aa gyy، lykn yh khtay hwyay kh an kay drmyan lwt mar kay baray myn bay aymany hay tw as nay hr ayk aadmy kw kha kh wh asay apnay hath myn lay lay۔ as myn as nay kha kh an myn ghnymt kay baray myn bay aymany thy wh asay gayay kay sr ky trh swnay ka ayk sr lay aayay awr jb as nay asay rkha tw aag aayy awr ghnymt kw kha gyy۔ as nay hmary kmzwry awr na ahly kw dykha awr hmyn ajazt day dy۔ *yh rwayt jwshwa ky khany kay anasr kw ykja krty hay js myn swrj kw khray rhnay ka hkm dya gya tha (jwshwa، 10:12) awr aachn kay gnah ky khany (jwshwa، 7:10 ayf ayf)۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4034","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh anhyn amr rzy allh anh nay btaya kh khybr kay dn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay kchh ashab aayay awr kha: flan flan shhyd awr flan flan shhyd، lykn jb wh ayk aysay shkhs kay pas phnchay js kay baray myn anhwn nay kha kh flan flan shhyd hay، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hrgz nhyn، myn nay asay ayk aysay aadmy kw dykha hay js kw as nay aatkaf myn lay lya tha۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh abn alkhtab jao awr lwgwn myn tyn bar aalan kr dw kh jnt myn srf mwmn hy dakhl hwn gay۔ as nay kha kh myn bahr nkla awr tyn bar aalan kya kh jnt myn srf ahl ayman hy dakhl hwn gay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4035","bjalh nay kha: myn jzb ka aalm tha۔ maawyh ahnaf kay chcha awr amr bn khtab ky wfat say ayk sal phlay۔ alkhtab hmyn an ka kht mla js myn anhwn nay mjwsywn myn say shady shdh jwrwn kw alg krnay ky hdayt dy thy jw mmnwah drjat kay andr thay۔ amr nay mjwsywn say abdalrhmn bn tk jzyh nhyn lya tha۔ awf nay gwahy dy kh rswl allh nay asay hjr kay mjwsywn say lya tha۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4036","maaz rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn ymn bhyja tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn hkm dya kh hr hlym myn say lay lw، yany jw blwght kw phnch chka hw، ayk dynar ya as kay brabr mafry myn، yany ymn kay kpray۔ *yh lfz jw kh aam twr pr ayk sft kwalyfayng thwb (lbas) hay، yhan khwd as many ky wzaht kay sath astamal kya gya hay kh mafr ayk qbylay ka nam hay jw ymn kay qbayly grwh hmdan ka ayk hsh tha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4037","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayk srzmyn myn dw qblay drst nhyn hyn awr mslman pr jzyh nhyn lgaya jayay ga۔ asay ahmd، trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4038","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay khald rzy allh anh kw bhyja۔ alwlyd kw dwma kay aqydyr kay pas phncha، awr jb wh asay pkr kr lay aayay tw as nay as ky jan bkhshy ky awr jzyh ada krnay ky shrt pr as say slh ky۔ *dwma tbwk kay qryb ayk qlah tha۔ aqydyr aysayy tha۔ yh waqah 9 hjry myn ghzwh tbwk kay dwran pysh aaya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4039","harb b. abydallh nay apnay dada، apny waldh kay wald ky snd say byan kya kh an kay pas apnay wald ky snd say hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \dswan hsh yhwdywn awr aysayywn pr aayd kya jayay ga، lykn mslmanwn pr aayd nhyn kya jayay ga۔\"" asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4040","aqbh by۔ aamr nay byan kya kh as nay kha: \khda kay rswl، hm aysay lwgwn kay pas aatay hyn jw hmary mhman nwazy nhyn krtay، nh an say hm pr wajb hay، awr hm an say kchh nhyn lytay۔\"" as nay jwab dya: \""agr wh aap pr zbrdsty lyna zrwry smjhyn tw aysa kryn۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"4041","aslm nay btaya kh amr bn alkhtab nay swna rkhnay walwn pr char dynar awr chandy rkhnay walwn pr chalys drhm mslmanwn kay lyay saman awr tyn dn ky mhman nwazy kay sath jzyh aayd kya۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4042","almswar b۔ mkhrmh awr mrwan by۔ alhkm nay byan kya hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hdybyh kay sal apnay ds sw say zayd ashab kay sath nklay awr jb zwalhlyfh phnchay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay phwlwn kay har phnayay awr an pr nshan lgayay، amrh kay lyay hrm myn dakhl hwyay awr phr aagay brhay۔ jb wh as phary dray pr phnchay js say mkh ky trf atrtay hyn tw as kay swar drnday ghtnay tyknay lgay awr lwgwn nay kha kh chlw، chlw! lykn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ’’alqsw‘‘ byzar nhyn hwyy، kywnkh yh as ky khswsyt nhyn hay، lykn js nay hathy kw rwka، as nay asay rwka۔ phr frmaya as ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، wh mjh say kwyy aysy achhy chyz nhyn mangyn gay js kay zryaay wh azt krtay hwn js chyz kw allh taalyٰ nay mqds qrar dya hay، bghyr myn asay dwn۔ phr as nay asay takyd ky awr wh achhl pry awr wh mkh ky srk say ayk trf mr gya awr hdybyh kay sb say dwr ayk talab pr rk gya js kw lwgwn nay bht km pany jma kya awr jld hy thk gya۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pyas ky shkayt ky gyy tw aap nay apnay trksh say ayk tyr nkala awr anhyn as myn dalnay ka hkm dya tw wh hyrany kay aalm myn an ky trf pany kay sath bhta rha yhan tk kh wh asay chhwr gyay۔ dryn asnaa bdyl by۔ wrqa alkhzaay khzaah awr arwh bn kay kchh arkan kay sath aayay۔ msawd as kay sath shaml hwa۔ wh rwayt 2 kay sath as mqam tk chlay gyay jhan anhwn nay kha kh jb shyl by۔ amrw rzy allh anh aayay tw nby sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: lkhw: yh why hay jw mhmd sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh kya hay۔ shyl nay ahtjaj krtay hwyay kha kh khda ky qsm agr hmyn malwm hw jata kh aap khda kay rswl hyn tw hm aap kw nh tw khanh bdwsh kryn gay awr nh hy aap say jng kryn gay blkh lkhyn: mhmd bn abdallh۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myn allh ka rswl hwn، khwah tm mjh say kfr krw، mhmd bn abdallh lkhw۔ shyl nay kha: awr yh kh hmaray pas say kwyy aadmy tmharay pas nhyn aayay ga، khwah wh tmharay mzhb ky pyrwy kray، jb tk kh tm asay hmaray pas waps nh bhyj dw۔ phr jb wh dstawyz tyar krnay say fargh hwa tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay sathywn say frmaya kh athw awr qrbany krw awr phr mndwao۔ as kay bad kchh mwmn awrtyn aayyn awr khdayay bzrg w brtr nay yh hkm nazl frmaya kh ’’aay ayman walw jb tmharay pas mwmn awrtyn hjrt kr kay aayyn۔‘‘ 3 allh taalyٰ nay anhyn waps bhyjnay say mna kya blkh mhr waps krnay ka hkm dya۔ jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mdynh waps aayay tw abw bsyr qrysh ka ayk shkhs jw mslman tha، aap kay pas aaya awr anhwn nay dw aadmywn kw an ky tlash kay lyay bhyja، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn an dw aadmywn kay hwalay kr dya۔ wh asay lay gyay awr jb zwalhlyfh phnchay awr kchh khjwryn khanay kay lyay atray tw abw bsyr nay ayk aadmy say kha kh myn khda ky qsm flan flan kw khta hwn kh aap ky yh tlwar achhy hay، mjhay asay dykhnay dw۔ as nay asay day dya awr asay mara yhan tk kh wh mr gya، as kay bad dwsra as say bhag gya awr jb mdynh phncha tw bhagta hwa msjd myn chla gya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as aadmy nay kwyy khwfnak chyz dykhy hay۔ as nay kha: \myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myra sathy mara gya hay، awr myn mrnay kay brabr hwn۔\"" 4 abw bsyr aayay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""afsws as ky man pr، jng myn bhrkanay waly، kash as kay kwyy rshth dar hwtay!\"" abw jndl by۔ shyl frar hw kr abw bsyr kay sath hw gya awr yh dstwr hw gya kh qrysh ka hr wh aadmy jw aslam qbwl kr kay nkla abw bsyr kay sath hw gya yhan tk kh an ka ayk grwh jma hw gya۔ jb bhy anhwn nay qrysh kay ksy qaflay ky sham ky trf nklnay ky khbr sny tw anhwn nay asay rwk lya، an lwgwn kw qtl kr dya awr an ka saman chhyn lya۔ chnanchh qrysh nay pyghmbr kw pygham bhyja kh aap kw khda ky trf say awr aaps kay rshtwn kay bndhn myn bndhnay ky hdayt kryn awr as bat pr razy hw jayyn kh jw kwyy aap kay pas aayay ga wh mhfwz rhay ga۔ chnanchh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn hdayat bhyjyn۔ 1. Cf. alqraan؛ 105. 2. as say malwm hwta hay kh yhan bkhary ky rwayt ka ayk hsh chhwr dya gya hay۔ 3. alqraan۔ 60:10. 4. lfzy twr pr \""awr myn mara gya hwn۔\"" 5. lfzy twr pr \""kash as kay pas kwyy hwta!\"" ghalbaً as ka mtlb yh hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm ky khwahsh thy kh abw bsyr kay pas kwyy rshth dar hwta js kay pas wh ja skta awr as lyay asay dwbarh zrwrt say bchana tha۔"""""
"4043","albraa b۔ aazb khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hdybyh kay dn mshrkyn say tyn batwn ka maahdh kya: jw kwyy an kay pas aayay asay wh mshrkwn kw lwta dyn، lykn jw mslman an kay pas aayay anhyn waps nh kryn۔ kh wh aglay sal mkh myn dakhl hw awr as myn tyn dn qyam kray۔ awr yh kh wh as myn srf tlwar awr kman jysay hthyar lay kr dakhl hw۔ phr abw jndl apny byrywn myn jkray hwyay aayay awr anhyn an kay pas waps bhyj dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4044","ans byan krtay hyn kh qrysh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say yh shrt rkhy kh agr kwyy an kay pas aayay tw asay waps nh bhyjyn، lykn agr kwyy an ky trf say an kay pas aayay tw asay waps bhyj dyn۔ anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh kya wh asay lkh dyn، aap nay jwab dya: han، allh taalyٰ as kw apny rhmt say dwr kr day jw hm say an kay pas jayay، lykn jw kwyy an kay pas say hmaray pas aayay ga، allh as kay lyay njat awr nklnay ka rasth bnayay ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4045","aayshh rzy allh anha nay awrtwn say byat lynay kay baray myn kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm an ka amthan as aayt say lya krtay thay: \aay nby، jb mwmn awrtyn aap say byat krnay aayyn...\"" (alqraan؛ 60:12)۔ jb an myn say ayk nay as shrt kw tslym kya tw as nay as say kha، \""myn nay tm say ahd kya hay،\"" yh srf an alfaz say kya jw as nay as say khay thay۔ byat kay wqt an ka hath ksy awrt kay hath kw nhyn lga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4046","almswar awr mrwan nay kha kh wh ds sal tk jng trk krnay pr razy hyn js kay dwran lwgwn kw thfz hasl hwga، as bnyad pr kh an kay drmyan akhlas hw awr chwry ya khyant nh hw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4047","sfwan by۔ slym nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ashab kay mtadd bytwn ky rwayt ka hwalh dya jnhwn nay apnay aabaa w ajdad ky snd say byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy ksy aysay shkhs pr zlm kray js kay sath ahd kya gya hw، ya as kay ksy hq myn tkhfyf kray، ya as ky taqt say zyadh as pr dalay، ya as say kwyy chyz lay lay tw myn as kay aqd kay dn as kay dwbarh zndh hw jaon ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4048","amymh bnt rqyqh khty hyn kh myn nay kchh awrtwn kay sath rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say byat ky awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay hm say frmaya jhan tk tm myn asttaat hay myn nay kha kh allh awr as ka rswl hm pr as say zyadh mhrban hyn jtna hm apny zat pr۔ myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say hmaray ahd ky twsyq krnay kw kha، yany hm say msafhh krna، lykn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn sw awrtwn say why khta hwn jysa kh myn ayk say krta hwn۔ … asay mntql kya. rwayat kay as mjmwaay ka nam chhwr dya gya hay jhan yh paya jata hay۔ sy ayf nsayy، bya، 18؛ abn majh، jhad، 43; ahmd by hnbly، jld، s۔ 357; malk، mwta، bya، 1۔"
"4049","albraa b۔ aazb nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm zwalqadh myn amrh krnay kay lyay tshryf lay gyay، lykn ahl mkh nay aap kw mkh myn dakhl hwnay say ankar kr dya yhan tk kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an kay sath dakhl hwnay awr tyn dn qyam ka maahdh kr lya۔ phr jb dstawyz lkhtay wqt anhwn nay lkha kh \yh why hay js pr mhmd rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay atfaq kya hay،\"" mkh walwn nay kha، \""hm asay tslym nhyn krtay، kywnkh agr hmyn malwm hwta kh aap allh kay rswl hyn tw hm aap kw rwk nhyn sktay، lykn aap tw mhmd bn abdallh hyn۔\"" as nay jwab dya kh myn allh ka rswl awr mhmd bn abdallh dwnwn hwn۔ phr as nay aly bn say kha۔ abw talb nay \""khda kay rswl\"" kw mtanay kay lyay، awr jb as nay ahtjaj kya، \""nhyn، myn khda ky qsm khata hwn، myn asay kbhy nhyn mtaon ga،\"" rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asay lay lya، awr agrchh wh achha nhyn lkhtay thay، anhwn nay lkha، '' yh why hay jw mhmd sly allh alyh wslm hay. abdallh razy hw gya۔ wh wahd hthyar js kay sath wh mkh myn dakhl hw ga wh tlwar hw gy agr as kay lwgwn myn say kwyy as ky pyrwy krna chahay tw wh asay nhyn nkalay ga۔ awr agr as kay sathywn myn say kwyy as myn rhna chahay tw asay mna nhyn kray ga۔ phr jb wh dakhl hwyay awr mqrrh mdt gzr gyy tw wh aly kay pas gyay awr an say kha kh wh apnay dwst say khay kh wh an kw mqrrh mdt gzr janay tk chhwr day ۔ chnanchh nbyﷺ bahr tshryf lay gyay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4050","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb hm msjd myn thay tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm bahr tshryf layay awr frmaya: yhwdywn kay pas aao۔ chnanchh hm aap sly allh alyh wslm kay sath bahr nklay awr as ghr myn phnchay jhan anhwn nay apna shyfh prha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm khray hwyay awr frmaya: ”agr tm yhwdy aslam qbwl kr lw gay tw tm mhfwz rhw gay، jan lw kh yh zmyn allh awr as kay rswl ky hay، awr myn tmhyn as mlk say nkalnay ka aradh rkhta hwn، lhza agr tm myn say ksy kay pas mal hay tw wh asay bych day“۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4051","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh amr rzy allh anh tqryr krnay kay lyay khray hwyay awr kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay khybr kay yhwdywn kw an kay mal myn kam krnay pr mamwr kya awr an say kha kh jb tk allh kray ga myn as myn an ky tsdyq krwn ga awr ab myn nay an kw jlawtn krnay myn bhlayy dykhy hay۔ jb amr rzy allh anh nay yh fyslh kya tw by abw alhqyq myn say ayk an kay pas aaya awr khnay lga: ”aay amyr almwmnyn، kya aap hmyn nkal rhay hyn jb kh mhmd nay hmary jayydad ky tsdyq kr dy hay awr hmyn as kay kam pr mamwr kya hay؟ amr rzy allh anh nay jwab dya: kya tm smjhtay hw kh myn bhwl gya hwn jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya tha jb aap nay pwchha tha kh jb aap kw khybr say nkal dya gya tw aap kysa mhsws hwga، aap ka awnt rat kw aap kay sath dwr rha hay؟ as nay kha، yh abwalqasm ky trf say ayk chhwta sa mzaq tha، js pr amr nay jwab dya، \tm jhwt bwltay hw، khda kay dshmn۔\"" as kay bad as nay an kw mlk bdr kr dya، an kay pas jw phl an kay pas tha an ky qymt rqm، awnt awr saman jysay zyn، rsy wghyrh۔ bkhary nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"4052","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay tyn hdayat dy thyn kh mshrkyn kw arb say nkal dw، wfdwn kw myn nay jysa bdlh dya tha۔ abn abas rzy allh anhma nay kha kh ya tw anhwn nay tysray ka zkr nhyn kya ya phr asay bhwl gya hay۔ *yany abn abas۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4053","jabr by۔ abdallh nay kha kh anhyn amr bn khtab nay btaya tha۔ alkhtab rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna tha kh myn arb say yhwdywn awr aysayywn kw zrwr nkal dwn ga takh whan srf mslmanwn kw hy chhwrwn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ ayk nskhh yh hay kh ’’agr myn zndh rha tw anshaa allh myn yhwdywn awr aysayywn kw arb say zrwr nkal dwn ga۔"
"4054","abn amr nay byan kya kh amr bn alkhtab nay yhwdywn awr aysayywn kw hjaz ky srzmyn say jlawtn kya awr jb khybr kay lwgwn pr khda kay rswl kw ghlbh hasl hwa tw aap nay yhwd kw whan say nkalnay ka aradh kya kywnkh jb srzmyn fth hwyy tw yh khda، as kay rswl awr mslmanwn ky thy۔ lykn yhwdywn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say drkhwast ky kh wh an kw as shrt pr chhwr dyn kh wh tmam khyty kryn awr aadhy pydawar hasl kryn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya kh jb tk hm chahyn gay hm as shrt pr aap ky tsdyq kryn gay۔ chnanchh an ky tsdyq hw gyy yhan tk kh amr rzy allh anh nay anhyn apnay dwr hkwmt myn tyma awr jyrykw myn jlawtn kr dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4055","mlk b۔ aws b۔ alhadsn nay amr bn khtab rzy allh anh say rwayt ky hay kh allh taalyٰ nay apnay rswl kw as fzylt myn ayk khas hsh mqrr kya hay jw ksy awr kw nhyn dya، phr anhwn nay yh tlawt frmayy kh allh nay apnay rswl kw an myn say jw kchh ata kya hay۔ . . qadr mtlq\ (alqraan؛ 59:6) yh khalstaً khda kay rswl kay lyay tha jw as jayydad myn say apnay khandan kw salanh hsh dytay thay، phr jw bcha tha asay lay lytay awr khda ky jayydad kay sath as kay sath maamlh krtay thay۔ *fay' mslmanwn kay fth krdh alaqay say khraj kay lyay astamal hwta hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4056","amr rzy allh anh nay kha kh bn nadr ky jayydadyn an chyzwn ka hsh thyn jw allh taalyٰ nay apnay rswl kw ata ky thyn jn kw hasl krnay kay lyay mslman ghwrwn ya awntwn pr swar nhyn hwyay thay۔ chnanchh wh khas twr pr khda kay rswl say talq rkhtay thay jnhwn nay apnay khandan kw salanh chndh dya، phr jw kchh hthyarwn awr ghwrwn kay lyay bcha tha asay rah khda myn astamal kya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4057","awf by۔ malk rzy allh anh nay kha: jb fayy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as dn asay tqsym kr dya، dw hsay ayk shady shdh kw awr ayk hsh bychlr kw dya۔ mjhay blaya gya awr as nay mjhay dw hsay dyyay، kywnkh myra ayk khandan tha۔ phr amar bn myray bad yasr kw blaya gya awr ayk dya gya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4058","abn amr rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh myn nay dykha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay sb say phlay jw kam kya fwraً an kay pas yh tha kh aazad kyay gyay lwgwn kw kchh dyn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4059","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas mwtywn ky ayk thyly layy gyy awr asay aazad awrtwn awr lwndywn myn tqsym kr dya۔ as nay btaya kh as kay wald aazad awr ghlamwn myn chyzyn tqsym krtay thay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4060","mlk b۔ aws b۔ alhadsn nay byan kya kh ayk dn amr bn alkhtab nay as fayy ka tzkrh krtay hwyay kha: myn tm say zyadh as fayy ka hq nhyn rkhta، awr hm myn say kwyy bhy dwsray say zyadh as ka hqdar nhyn hay، swayay as kay kh hm khda ky ktab jw azym awr azym hay awr as kay rswl ky trf say mtayn krdh apnay ahdwn pr fayz hwn، aslam qbwl krnay myn lwgwn kw an ky trjyhat kay mtabq trtyb dya jayay، an ky mshklat awr an ky awlad kw brdasht kya jayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4061","anhwn nay btaya kh amr bn alkhtab nay tlawt ky، \sdqh ghrybwn awr mhtajwn kay lyay hay... jannay walay، hkmt walay،\"" (alqraan؛ 9:60) awr kha kh yh aayt aysay lwgwn pr lagw hwty hay۔ phr aap nay tlawt frmayy، ’’jan lw kh jw mal ghnymt tm hasl krtay hw as ka panchwan hsh khda awr rswl ... msafrwn kw jata hay‘‘ (alqraan؛ 8:41) awr kha kh yh aayt aysay lwgwn pr lagw hwty hay۔ as kay bad as nay tlawt ky، \""jw kchh khda nay apnay rswl kw bstywn kay lwgwn ky trf say ... ghrybwn kw ata kya hay\"" (alqraan؛ 59:7 f. zkr krdh aakhry lfz aayt 8 ka phla lfz hay۔ as ka mtlb yh hwskta hay kh as nay aayt 8 ky pwry tlawt ky)۔ as kay bad as nay tlawt ky، \""awr jw an kay bad aayay،\"" (alqraan؛ 59:10) yh khtay hwyay kh as myn tmam mslman shaml hyn، awr mzyd kha kh agr wh hmyar kay srh myn chrwaha rhta tw asay as ka hsh zrwr mlta jw as nay apny pyshany kay psynay say nhyn kmaya tha۔ * as lfz ka mtlb hay phary dhlwan wady kay awpr، nh kh phar pr۔ jb hmyar say mnslk hwta hay tw kha jata hay kh as ka mtlb an ky bsty، cf hay۔ yaqwt، majm، iii، 82۔ hmyaryan jnwby arb kay mshhwr lwg thay۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"""""
"4062","anhwn nay btaya kh amr rzy allh anh ky trf say pysh krdh dlylwn myn say ayk yh thy kh anhwn nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw tyn chyzyn khas twr pr apnay lyay mly hyn: by nadr، khybr awr fdk، 1 by nadr jayydad mkml twr pr apnay mqasd kay lyay rkhy gyy thy، 2 fdk msafrwn kay lyay، awr khybr kw allh kay rswl nay dw khandanwn kay lyay awr ayk khandan kay lyay mslmanwn kay lyay tqsym kya tha۔ agr aap kay ghr walwn kw chndh dynay kay bad kchh bcha tw aap nay ghryb mhajryn myn tqsym kr dya۔ 1. fdk khybr kay qryb tha۔ as nay bghyr lray sr tslym khm kr dya۔ 2۔ as myn zaty zrwryat kay alawh mhmanwn ky tfryh، hthyarwn awr janwrwn ky frahmy wghyrh kay akhrajat shaml hwn gay۔ asay abwdaod nay mntql kya hay۔"
"4063","almghyrh b۔ shabh nay byan kya kh jb amr bn abdalazyz kw khlyfh bnaya gya، as nay mrwan kay khandan kw jma kya awr kha: fdk rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka tha، awr as myn say chndh dya، as myn say bn hashm kay ghrybwn pr bar bar mhrbany ky awr as say saman frahm kya: as say an myn say jw ghyr shady shdh thay an ky shadywn kay akhrajat۔ fatmh nay as say kha kh wh asay day day lykn as nay ankar kr dya۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn maamlat asy trh khray rhay yhan tk kh aap sly allh alyh wslm apnay rastay pr chlay gyay (yany aap ky wfat hw gyy)۔ jb abwbkr kw hkmran bnaya gya tw anhwn nay as ka antzam asy trh kya jysa kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apny zndgy myn kya tha yhan tk kh wh apnay rastay pr chlay gyay۔ phr jb amr bn alkhtab kw hkmran bnaya gya as nay as ka antzam asy trh kya jysa kh wh apnay rastay pr chlay gyay۔ phr mrwan nay asay apnay lyay lya awr phr amr bn khtab kay pas aaya۔ abdalazyz، lykn myn smjhta hwn kh mjhay as chyz ka kwyy hq nhyn js say rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hzrt fatmh rzy allh anha kw ankar kr dya tha، awr myn aap kw gwah bnata hwn kh myn nay asay phlay ky halt myn bhal kr dya hay۔ yany rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm، abwbkr awr amr rzy allh anh kay zmanay myn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
